<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Shoe Carnival raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Shoe Carnival raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co said it upgraded Shoe Carnival Inc to &quot;aggressive buy&quot; from buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $10 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- said it expects Shoe Carnival to post three percent same-store sales gains this year.</p>
<p>-- expects company to open seven to 10 new stores this year and 15-20 next year.</p>
<p>-- Shoe Carnival was up 1/2 to 4-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
